Graphics Draw_Rect Save_Background 0.0 0.0 960.0 540.0 14 18 28 255
Graphics GUI_Begin Save_Menu
Graphics GUI_Text Save_Title "Save Menu"
Graphics GUI_Button Save_Slot_1 "Save Slot 1" None
Graphics GUI_Button Back_From_Save Back None
Graphics GUI_End

Graphics GUI_Button_Clicked Back_From_Save
Set_Var_Global Back_From_Save_Clicked GUI.Back_From_Save.Clicked
If Var Back_From_Save_Clicked == 1
{
	Set_Var Game_State Bananas/Game_Over
}

Return
